flowchart LR
  Shopper[Shopper] --> UI[Two-column JTV workspace]
  UI --> SDK[InstantSearch Chat SDK]
  SDK --> ChatAPI[Application /api/chat proxy]
  ChatAPI --> Guard{"Tool-sheet guard: agent's declared tools vs tools this build answers"}
  Guard -->|match| Agent[Agent Studio Concierge: dev or production agent, one definition]
  Guard -.->|mismatch: labelled 503| UI
  Agent -->|native tool| Search[algolia_search_index]
  Search --> Indexes[(Indexes configured on the agent: prod_catalog, blog, help_content)]
  Indexes --> Agent
  Agent -->|client tools| Tools[refresh_products, arrange_groups]
  Tools --> Executors[Application executors over read-only product lookups]
  Executors -->|structured results| Agent
  Executors --> Tiles[Workspace tiles, one column per group]
  Tiles --> UI
  UI --> Refresh[Exact-ID refresh API]
  Refresh --> Product[(prod_catalog, read-only)]
  UI --> State[Per-tab session state]

  subgraph Release["How a change reaches production"]
    direction LR
    Local["Change and test locally: npm run dev + dev agent"] --> Main["Merge to main: pull request, CI green"]
    Main --> Promote["Promote: scripts/baseline, agent then app"]
    Promote --> Prod["Production: Vercel app + production agent"]
    Prod --> Verify["verify-baseline.mjs"]
  end
